    D('FRA', 'EolMed (Gruissan)', depth=(60, 60), rotor=164, url=['https://www.offshorewind.biz/2026/04/21/eolmed-partners-switch-on-french-floating-wind-pilot-project/', 'https://www.vestas.com/en/media/mwow-press-releases/2018/mhi-vestas-launches-the-first-10-mw-wind-turbine-in-history'], zh='offshoreWIND.biz（2026-04 併網）：水深約 60 m、3 部 Vestas V164-10.0 MW；Vestas 新聞稿：V164-10.0 MW 葉輪 164 m。輪轂高度未查到（新聞稿的約 105 m 是機型的一般值，不是本場建成值）。', en='offshoreWIND.biz (energised Apr 2026): about 60 m of water, three Vestas V164-10.0 MW; Vestas release: the V164-10.0 MW has a 164 m rotor. Hub height not found (the release’s approximate 105 m is a generic figure for the model, not this farm’s as-built value).'),
