    D('JPN', 'Kitakyushu Hibikinada', rotor=174, url='https://www.offshorewind.biz/2025/09/17/all-vestas-turbines-stand-at-220-mw-japanese-offshore-wind-farm', zh='offshoreWIND.biz（2025-09）：25 部 Vestas V174-9.6 MW 全部裝設完成，葉輪 174 m（Vestas 型號數字即葉輪直徑）；水深與輪轂高度未查到（日刊工業新聞的「距海面約 200 m」是葉尖高的約略值）。', en='offshoreWIND.biz (Sep 2025): all 25 Vestas V174-9.6 MW installed, i.e. a 174 m rotor (the Vestas model number is the rotor diameter); water depth and hub height not found (Nikkan Kogyo’s "about 200 m above the sea" is an approximate tip height).'),
