    D('CHN', 'Zhejiang Shengsi 2 Offshore wind farm', depth=(9.2, 12.2), hub=104, url='https://29634560.s21i.faiusr.com/61/ABUIABA9GAAgpofptwYorvi-iwM.pdf', zh='中廣核嵊泗 7 號環評報告書（2024）以已營運的嵊泗 2 號作類比（2022-03 營運期水下噪聲實測），表 3.2.2-4／3.2.2-11：31 台 6.45 MW＋32 台 6.25 MW、輪轂高度 104 m、海域水深 9.2–12.2 m（描述已建風場，不是本場設計值）；葉輪直徑未列。', en='The CGN Shengsi 7 EIA report (2024) uses the operating Shengsi 2 farm as a comparison (underwater noise measured in March 2022), tables 3.2.2-4 / 3.2.2-11: 31 × 6.45 MW + 32 × 6.25 MW, hub height 104 m, water depth 9.2–12.2 m (describing the built farm, not a design value); rotor not given.'),
    D('CHN', 'SPIC Peninsula South U1', depth=(25, 31), url='http://nyj.shandong.gov.cn/art/2023/3/2/art_253733_10296377.html', zh='山東省能源局（2023-03，轉大眾日報）：半島南 U 場址位於乳山南側海域、平均水深 25–31 m。一期 53 台明陽 MySE8.5-230 的輪轂 130.9 m、葉輪 230 m（山東省能源局 2023-11）只屬一期，二期機型未查到，不填。', en='Shandong Energy Administration (March 2023, via Dazhong Daily): the Peninsula South U site lies south of Rushan in 25–31 m of water (average). Phase 1’s 53 MingYang MySE8.5-230 have a 130.9 m hub and 230 m rotor (Shandong Energy Administration, Nov 2023), phase 1 only; phase 2’s model was not found, so they are not given.'),
    D('CHN', "Datang Nan'ao Lemen I", depth=(18, 27), hub=105, rotor=154, url='https://www.shantou.gov.cn/attachment/0/156/156038/2544766.pdf', zh='大唐南澳勒門Ⅰ變更海域使用補充論證報告書（汕頭市政府公開，2026 年，「本次論證根據實際建設方案」）：35 台上海電氣 7 MW，風機直徑 154 m、輪轂高度 105 m（原核准方案寫 100 m）；場址水深 18–27 m。', en="Datang Nan'ao Lemen I supplementary sea-use report (Shantou government, 2026, \"based on the actual construction scheme\"): 35 Shanghai Electric 7 MW turbines, rotor 154 m, hub 105 m (the approved scheme said 100 m); site water depth 18–27 m."),
